3. **Retry Logic**: Implement retry logic within the `AsyncFileUploadService`. You can use a simple exponential backoff strategy with jitter, for instance:

```csharp
private async Task<bool> RetryUpload(CancellationToken cancellationToken)
{
    int retries = 0;
    TimeSpan delay = TimeSpan.Zero;

    while (retries < MaxRetries)
    {
        try
        {
            // Perform the actual upload here
            await UploadFileAsync(cancellationToken);
            return true;
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            _logger.LogError(ex, "Upload failed. Retrying...");
            if (++retries == MaxRetries)
                return false;

            // Adjust the delay based on retries and jitter
            delay += TimeSpan.FromMilliseconds((uint)(delay.TotalMilliseconds * JitterFactor));
            await Task.Delay(delay, cancellationToken);
        }
    }

    _logger.LogWarning("Maximum retries reached for the upload.");
    return false;
}
```

