The code is thread-safe due to the use of pthread_mutex_lock() and pthread_mutex_unlock(), but it does not currently evaluate the need for concurrent processing based on your requirements. To do so, you would need to modify the get_external_data() function and consider potential concurrency issues when accessing shared resources.

